uos-ai-libre (1.0.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Show the main window before dispatching FollowAlong actions so busy or
    unconfigured-model errors are visible instead of silently dismissing.
  * Restore the X11 more-menu order and make every action row clickable.
  * Use a pointing-hand cursor for all FollowAlong toolbar and menu rows.
  * Cover all FollowAlong action prompt types in dde-payload-test.

