uos-ai-libre (1.0.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Keep the Treeland FollowAlong surface at a fixed footprint while the icon
    expands and the more menu opens; reapply the visible-area input mask after
    every show so transparent pixels never steal clicks.
  * Keep the 200 ms chevron rotation visible now that the compositor no longer
    re-places the surface mid-animation.

