uos-ai-libre (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Provide drop-in replacements for uos-ai, uos-ai-rag and uos-ai-agent.
  * Include AI FollowAlong on X11 and Treeland, plus the native dde-shell
    dock applet org.deepin.ds.dock.aibar.
  * Clamp the FollowAlong toolbar to the available screen on every edge and
    recreate the Treeland overlay at the expanded size so dde-shell's one-shot
    placement hint cannot push the pill off screen.
  * Keep the UOS AI main window independent from FollowAlong click-away
    dismissal; FollowAlong actions reuse the existing window and add a new
    aish session instead of opening another window.

